    - target: {fileID: 3597188916978721012, guid: 98a626b4b217d8e4aa01d249decb66e5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: body
      value: "The entire cosmos is buzzing with incredible news. Scientists at the
        Galactic Academy of Sciences have managed to determine the source of the
        beta signal. As it turns out, it\u2019s not a planet or an asteroid, but\u2026
        whales! Yes, that\u2019s right - giant galactic whales! The sound produced
        by these enormous whales is the beta signal.\\n\\n The first galactic whale
        was discovered on Research Planet No. 6, where observation will continue.\\n\\n
        So far, none of the whales have reacted to our researchers. But how long
        will that last? Perhaps it\u2019s time to prepare an evacuation ship?\\n "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3597188916978721012, guid: 98a626b4b217d8e4aa01d249decb66e5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: title
      value: A new species has been discovered!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
