    - target: {fileID: 3597188916978721012, guid: 98a626b4b217d8e4aa01d249decb66e5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: body
      value: "We managed to interview a scientist from Research Planet No. 6. Now
        the veil of mystery will be lifted, and we\u2019ll finally learn the truth
        about these dangerous creatures - galactic whales.\\n\\n <b>Interviewer:</b>
        Good afternoon!!!\\n <b>Scientist:</b>  \u2026Good afternoon.\\n <b>Interviewer:</b> 
        How big are the galactic whales? How are you able to see them (I can barely
        see anything)? Are they very different from our Earth whales? Have they attacked
        you? Does the beta signal affect you?\\n <b>Scientist:</b>  \u2026\\n <b>Scientist:</b> 
        Galactic whales are incredibly large, but you can only observe them through
        a special device. So far, the beta signal hasn\u2019t affected us, and it
        can also only be detected with specialized equipment. All the devices are
        built into my suit.\\n <b>Scientist:</b>  The galactic whales themselves
        look the same as Earth whales: one tail, two fins, two eyes. Nothing unusual.\\n
        <b>Scientist:</b>  No one has attacked us.\\n <b>Interviewer:</b>  Ah, thank
        you very much. So, no one has attacked you.\\n\\n So those are the galactic
        whales. Our team tried to contact this scientist for a second interview,
        but it turned out he is no longer on Research Planet No. 6. We haven\u2019t
        been able to locate him yet (it\u2019s as if he vanished without a trace
        haha), but perhaps we\u2019ll manage to interview a new one!\\n "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3597188916978721012, guid: 98a626b4b217d8e4aa01d249decb66e5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: title
      value: Danger or peaceful coexistence?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3597188916978721012, guid: 98a626b4b217d8e4aa01d249decb66e5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: archives
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1625932546}
    - target: {fileID: 3776002049330589092, guid: 98a626b4b217d8e4aa01d249decb66e5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: A3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
