--- !u!114 &2008810602
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2008810599}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 05814dd3d78db004baf6bc712fe86ab0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  story1:
  - 'Phoenix: hey hey. This is Phoenix'
  - 'Phoenix: newbie, you here?'
  - 'Phoenix: Planet 6?'
  - 'You: Who is this?'
  - "Leo: We\u2019re scientists from Research Planet\u2026"
  - "Phoenix: we\u2019re from Planet 3"
  - "Leo: \u2026"
  - "Leo: Research Planets 2, 3, and 6 share a common communication network. Planet
    2 is currently unoccupied, so it\u2019s just the three of us on the network.
    My name is Leo. "
  - 'Phoenix: what are you gonna do over there on 6?'
  - "Phoenix: we\u2019re watching whales"
  - 'Phoenix: Research Group 3 is observing the migration of galactic whales'
  - "You: I\u2019m writing an article about the beta signal. And I\u2019ll be observing
    the whales"
  - 'Phoenix: beta signal'
  - 'Phoenix: I read an article once. <b>Article 1 (to read articles press R click
    A1 article)</b>'
  story2:
  - 'Leo: Slenderman? Seriously?'
  - 'Phoenix: I used to think it was Cthulhu'
  - 'Leo: ...'
  - "Leo: I\u2019m off to do some work. Later, kids."
  - 'Phoenix: eh. I gotta go too. bye'
  - 'You: bye'
  story3:
  - 'Phoenix: do you read second article?'
  - "Phoenix: aren\u2019t you scared?"
  - 'You: why should I be scared?'
  - "Phoenix: they say the previous scientist from Planet 6 ran away. Some say the
    whales ate him. Probably he just got bored and left. A year ago people talked
    a lot about the whales. But they don\u2019t pay any attention to us. And sitting
    alone on a planet must be really lonely. Article 3 "
  - 'Phoenix: already preparing an escape ship?'
  - "You: the whales aren\u2019t dangerous"
  - 'You: And I want to decipher the beta signal'
  - 'You: And I have a connection with the Main Center. So nothing will happen'
  - 'Phoenix: well'
  - 'Phoenix: good luck'
  - 'Leo: Did you read instructions? <b>Article 4</b>'
  - 'Leo: I think the integration of the magnifier into the spacesuit has significantly
    simplified its use.'
  - 'Leo: Use the binocular.'
  story4:
  - 'Me: guys'
  - 'Me: do you see this too?'
  - 'You: I discovered additional eyes on the whales'
  - "You: Galactic whales aren\u2019t supposed to have many eyes"
  - "Leo: Yes. They\u2019re not supposed to."
  - 'Phoenix: no. Everything looks normal on our side.'
  - 'Leo: Keep observing.'
  - 'Leo: Report if anything changes.'
  story5:
  - 'Phoenix: so booooring'
  - 'Phoenix: since it broke, the radio got completely dull'
  - 'Phoenix: 6, does yours work?'
  - "You: nope, mine doesn\u2019t either"
  - 'Phoenix: saaad'
  - 'Leo: All supplies and a new radio will be delivered in a week.'
  - 'Leo: We need to talk. Privately.'
  - "Leo: The previous scientist from Research Planet No. 6\u2026"
  - "Leo: He\u2026"
  - "Leo: Never mind\u2026"
  - "Leo: It\u2019s all just rumors."
  - 'Leo: All the best.'
  story6:
  - 'You: The eyes are spreading.'
  - 'You: On the body, the tail. Almost the whole group.'
  - 'Phoenix: wait'
  - "Phoenix: didn\u2019t the previous researcher see\u2026"
  - 'Leo: he was sick. High fever. '
  - 'Leo: Keep observing'
  - "Leo: Writing privately. I\u2019m not supposed to cause panic."
  - "Leo: \u2026"
  - 'Leo: The previous researcher saw them too.'
  - "Leo: \u2026"
  - 'Leo: The eyes'
  - 'Leo: Check the whales again.'
  story7:
  - 'You: Guys. Did you see that? <b>Signal lost.</b>'
  - 'You: Planet 3? <b>Signal lost.</b>'
  - 'You: Writing to the Main Center.'
  - 'You: My observations.'
  - 'You: At first, eyes appeared on one whale. On its body. After that, eyes began
    appearing on many others. Almost the entire group - body, tail, fins.'
  - 'You: After some time, the affected individuals fell.'
  - 'You: Unknown what this is. Unknown how it spreads.'
  - 'You: I can only wait for the next group.'
  - 'You: <b>Signal lost.</b>'
  story8:
  - 'Main Center: Research Planet No. 6. Can you hear us?'
  - 'Main Center: We managed to restore communication.'
  - 'Main Center: A supply ship will arrive in one day.'
  - "You: \u2026no."
  - "You: Don\u2019t come to me."
  - 'You: Ever.'
  - 'You: I am infected. The Eye appeared on my hand...'
  BinocleMode: {fileID: 690442358}
